## Class list

We use the `class_list` helper extensively throughout our components. It's a helper to help
us concatenate classes together, and conditionally add them to the class list.

```rb
# class_list('block w-full rounded-md', 'ring-1 ring-inset', 'text-red-900 ring-red-300': error?)

def class_list(*args, **kwargs)
  conditional_classes = kwargs.keys.select { |key| kwargs[key] }
  class_list = args + conditional_classes
  class_list.join(" ")
end
```
